{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World of Sea Battle Demo </strong>allows players to immerse themselves in the gameplay of <strong>World of Sea Battle</strong> with several key differences:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shop and any other forms of monetization are <strong>NOT</strong> present in the Demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited ships available for construction: the imperial branch, unique, premium, and regular ships of rank 1 cannot be built.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World of Sea Battle</strong> is an <strong>action-packed, open-world MMO</strong> set in the Golden Age of Sail. With <strong>dozens of historical sailing ships</strong>, <strong>pirates</strong>, <strong>PvP &amp; PvE</strong>, <strong>player-driven economy</strong>, and <strong>territorial guild wars</strong>, this historical naval experience will put you at the helm as you sail, fight, upgrade, and trade alongside other players in search of glory on the high seas!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/ea2257a52ed260de523da6036c901bc6.poster.avif?t=1760438434\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/ea2257a52ed260de523da6036c901bc6.webm?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/ea2257a52ed260de523da6036c901bc6.mp4?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome aboard!</strong> You are but one of many captains on the high seas. <strong>Trade, loot, explore, and wage war</strong> as you fight for <strong>control, glory, and riches</strong>! Will you fade as a nameless wreck or rise as a legend feared by foes and honored by allies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From a modest schooner to a gigantic man o\u2019 war and beyond, you\u2019re at the helm of your fine journey, Captain</strong>. Featuring over <strong>50 upgradable and customizable historical ships</strong> from the Golden Age of Sail - <strong>schooners, galleons, brigantines, frigates, and so much more</strong> - the Archipelago rarely sees the same ships wandering the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/1d44af738adfee65fd8ec7a874f75c66.poster.avif?t=1760438434\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/1d44af738adfee65fd8ec7a874f75c66.webm?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/1d44af738adfee65fd8ec7a874f75c66.mp4?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sail ho!</strong> Enemy ship on the horizon! Man your ship and show off the menacing captain that you are by engaging in <strong>epic PvE or PvP Naval Battles</strong>! Use <strong>round shots, heated shots, chain shots, and many more</strong> to beat the odds and become a feared ruler of the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/b6ab163dfb4a2dcaf41ff6874e881fb1.poster.avif?t=1760438434\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/b6ab163dfb4a2dcaf41ff6874e881fb1.webm?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/b6ab163dfb4a2dcaf41ff6874e881fb1.mp4?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set sail into the unknown</strong> as you push past the edges of the map into the Boundless Sea - uncharted, untamed, and full of mystery. Amass enough gold, and you can claim your own private island - an outpost of power where fleets are mended and riches flow in from distant mines and workshops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/b3cdba22c0749a5625b92eb46461d93c.poster.avif?t=1760438434\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/b3cdba22c0749a5625b92eb46461d93c.webm?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/b3cdba22c0749a5625b92eb46461d93c.mp4?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold fuels everything</strong> - and how you earn it is up to you. <strong>Raid merchant ships for loot, build trade empires through production chains, transport rare goods between regions, or fish the seas for profit</strong>. Whether through battle or business, fortune favors the bold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/adb91f780c56b0258fb9152dbe91e9eb.poster.avif?t=1760438434\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/adb91f780c56b0258fb9152dbe91e9eb.webm?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/adb91f780c56b0258fb9152dbe91e9eb.mp4?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While sailing solo has its pros, it can be incredibly risky. <strong>Team up with friends or form a crew and rule the seas</strong>. For larger battles and deeper strategy, <strong>join a guild</strong> and dive into port wars, politics, and the race for dominance across the Archipelago!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3140370?t=1760438434","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/81b7e5ad7f3d762a64499f9ba424d0bf0cd95a25/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760438434","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/136d2fc65f81dcc895a4b10633b0e95830c79a6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760438434","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/136d2fc65f81dcc895a4b10633b0e95830c79a6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760438434","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World of Sea Battle Demo </strong>allows players to immerse themselves in the gameplay of <strong>World of Sea Battle</strong> with several key differences:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shop and any other forms of monetization are <strong>NOT</strong> present in the Demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited ships available for construction: the imperial branch, unique, premium, and regular ships of rank 1 cannot be built.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World of Sea Battle</strong> is an <strong>action-packed, open-world MMO</strong> set in the Golden Age of Sail. With <strong>dozens of historical sailing ships</strong>, <strong>pirates</strong>, <strong>PvP &amp; PvE</strong>, <strong>player-driven economy</strong>, and <strong>territorial guild wars</strong>, this historical naval experience will put you at the helm as you sail, fight, upgrade, and trade alongside other players in search of glory on the high seas!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/ea2257a52ed260de523da6036c901bc6.poster.avif?t=1760438434\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/ea2257a52ed260de523da6036c901bc6.webm?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/ea2257a52ed260de523da6036c901bc6.mp4?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome aboard!</strong> You are but one of many captains on the high seas. <strong>Trade, loot, explore, and wage war</strong> as you fight for <strong>control, glory, and riches</strong>! Will you fade as a nameless wreck or rise as a legend feared by foes and honored by allies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From a modest schooner to a gigantic man o\u2019 war and beyond, you\u2019re at the helm of your fine journey, Captain</strong>. Featuring over <strong>50 upgradable and customizable historical ships</strong> from the Golden Age of Sail - <strong>schooners, galleons, brigantines, frigates, and so much more</strong> - the Archipelago rarely sees the same ships wandering the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/1d44af738adfee65fd8ec7a874f75c66.poster.avif?t=1760438434\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/1d44af738adfee65fd8ec7a874f75c66.webm?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/1d44af738adfee65fd8ec7a874f75c66.mp4?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sail ho!</strong> Enemy ship on the horizon! Man your ship and show off the menacing captain that you are by engaging in <strong>epic PvE or PvP Naval Battles</strong>! Use <strong>round shots, heated shots, chain shots, and many more</strong> to beat the odds and become a feared ruler of the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/b6ab163dfb4a2dcaf41ff6874e881fb1.poster.avif?t=1760438434\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/b6ab163dfb4a2dcaf41ff6874e881fb1.webm?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/b6ab163dfb4a2dcaf41ff6874e881fb1.mp4?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set sail into the unknown</strong> as you push past the edges of the map into the Boundless Sea - uncharted, untamed, and full of mystery. Amass enough gold, and you can claim your own private island - an outpost of power where fleets are mended and riches flow in from distant mines and workshops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/b3cdba22c0749a5625b92eb46461d93c.poster.avif?t=1760438434\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/b3cdba22c0749a5625b92eb46461d93c.webm?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/b3cdba22c0749a5625b92eb46461d93c.mp4?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold fuels everything</strong> - and how you earn it is up to you. <strong>Raid merchant ships for loot, build trade empires through production chains, transport rare goods between regions, or fish the seas for profit</strong>. Whether through battle or business, fortune favors the bold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/adb91f780c56b0258fb9152dbe91e9eb.poster.avif?t=1760438434\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/adb91f780c56b0258fb9152dbe91e9eb.webm?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/extras/adb91f780c56b0258fb9152dbe91e9eb.mp4?t=1760438434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While sailing solo has its pros, it can be incredibly risky. <strong>Team up with friends or form a crew and rule the seas</strong>. For larger battles and deeper strategy, <strong>join a guild</strong> and dive into port wars, politics, and the race for dominance across the Archipelago!</p>","developers":["Thera Interactive"],"ext_user_account_notice":"World of Sea Battle Account (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","fullgame":{"appid":"2948190","name":"World of Sea Battle"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140370/170a4b7e4fa232783f315984d77694d1b804d6e6/header.jpg?t=1760438434","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3140370/754867861/1132c117534a13fff8d0bab2857a736a177d1026/1757004006/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760376224","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3140370/754867861/1132c117534a13fff8d0bab2857a736a177d1026/1757004006/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760376224","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3140370/754867861/1132c117534a13fff8d0bab2857a736a177d1026/1757004006/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760376224","id":257193264,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257193264/movie480.mp4?t=1760376224","max":"http